title: End to end › A request from referral to decision, denial and appeal
route: Across the whole product
intro: How one patient's request moves through the tabs. Follow the main path down the middle; the branches to the sides are what happens when the payer asks for more, denies, or approves.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "A referral arrives\nA clinic sends documents, or someone drops them in"
ext ref1 "Referrer sends documents"
screen nc1 "New Case › Intake\nThe referral's checklist of what is ready and what is missing"
agent rd "Reader reads the documents and fills the checklist"
decision d1 "Is the referral complete and acceptable?"
click askref "Ask the referrer\nor Decline or Override"
screen nc2 "New Case › Clinical documentation\nOne checklist for the documents the payer asks for"
ext emr "EMR Connect supplies the chart\nPull from EMR"
agent ver "Verify checks coverage and benefits\nEligibility & Benefits"
screen nc3 "New Case › Authorization preparation\nScribe, Criteria, Placement, Integrity, Forecaster ..."
decision d2 "Does an agent need an answer from you?"
input ans "Answer Scribe's question"
agent chance "Forecaster shows the approval chance"
screen nc4 "New Case › Review & submit\nNothing goes to the payer until a clinician signs"
click sign "Clinician signs\nSign and send"
store req "Request created\nStage: Received"
ext payer "Payer receives the request\n(demo: simulated)"
screen dash "Dashboard\nFour figures and the request list; stages: Preparing, Received, Under review, Info requested, Decided today, Appeal or call"
wait w1 "Payer decides\nTime passes (the Demo menu moves the clock)"
decision d3 "What does the payer decide?"
click info "Answer on the Dashboard\nSend the information requested"
end ok "Approved\nIn Case Manager: reviews are scheduled before the authorization ends"
screen den "Denial Intelligence\nWhere the denial is weak, options with chances"
decision d4 "Which route?"
doc p2p "Peer-to-peer brief and call"
doc app "Written appeal, signed and sent"
click acc "Accept the denial"
decision d5 "Overturned?"
endx lost "Denial stands\nRecorded and counted in Analytics"
screen ana "Analytics\nApproval by payer, denial reasons, what helps most"
screen mgr "Case Manager\nActive cases and Reviews this week"

s1 --> ref1 --> nc1 --> rd --> d1
d1 -->|Missing items| askref --> nc1
d1 -->|Ready| nc2
emr -.-> nc2
nc2 --> ver --> nc3
nc3 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| ans --> chance
d2 -->|No| chance
chance --> nc4 --> sign --> req --> payer --> dash --> w1 --> d3
d3 -->|Needs information| info --> w1
d3 -->|Approved| ok
d3 -->|Denied| den --> d4
d4 -->|Call| p2p --> d5
d4 -->|Appeal| app --> d5
d4 -->|Accept| acc --> lost
d5 -->|Yes| ok
d5 -->|No| lost
ok --> mgr
lost --> ana
ok --> ana
